        "content": "**Demo window 2025-01-01 \u2192 2025-02-28**  \nSynthetic anonymized demo data \u2014 not a real customer invoice.  \n\nNarrative: **Spend \u2192 Drivers \u2192 Risks \u2192 Actions \u2192 Alerts**  \nSections: A \u00b7 B \u00b7 C \u00b7 F \u00b7 G \u00b7 J *(D/E/H/I/K deferred to v1.1)*"
